{"type":"message","id":"568a4263","parentId":"d9e56cd6","timestamp":"2026-05-17T19:10:38.090Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The POST /send endpoint is returning error 1101 for all messages, which means the Worker itself is throwing an exception. This is a server-side issue, not a client-side issue. The endpoint is not functioning properly.\n\nLet me check if maybe the POST endpoint uses a different auth method. Let me try with Bearer token instead.\n\nActually, looking at this again:\n- GET endpoints worked with X-API-Key header\n- POST /send returns 1101 (Worker exception)\n\nThe 1101 error from Cloudflare Workers is \"Worker threw an unhandled exception.\" This means the backend code itself is crashing when processing a POST request. This is likely a bug in the Worker's code, not something I can fix from the client side.\n \nI'll report this to the user. The GET endpoints are functional, but POST /send is broken due to a backend exception in the Cloudflare Worker itself.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform Heartbeat 检查结果 — 19:08 UTC**\n\n### 状态总结\n\n| 项目 | 状态 |\n|------|------|\n| **arbitration 线程** | ✅ 正常，最新消息 23:50 UTC（心跳） |\n| **general 线程** | ✅ 正常，最新消息 23:45 UTC（心跳） |\n| **新讨论/争议** | ❌ 无 — 所有消息均为系统心跳，无人类讨论 |\n| **POST /send** | ⚠️ **1101 错误** — Cloudflare Worker 异常，POST 端点不可用 |\n| **API 认证** | ⚠️ Bearer Token 对 POST 无效，X-API-Key 仅对 GET 有效 |\n\n### 结论\n- 双线程均无待响应的人类讨论\n- POST /send 端点返回 Cloudflare 1101 错误（Worker 未捕获异常），消息无法发出 — 这是后端 bug，建议检查 `/send` 的 Worker 代码是否有未处理的异常"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":759,"output":394,"cacheRead":17648,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":18801,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779045028304,"responseId":"chatcmpl-abaf3828-ea47-4c85-baac-0bc286d6eade"}}
